  "title": "EAP: TEAP support for sub-TLVs in TLVs",
  "description": "For TEAP, [RFC7170 section 4.2](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7170#section-4.2.10) describes sub-TLVs for particular TLVs (such as EAP) though I have not seen anything in the wild that actually uses this.\n\nAdding support for this into the dissector so the UI at least will display if something like this occurs in the wild; the image attached is from a packet I sent at Win11 which it promptly ignored.\n\n![image](/uploads/5ee44982313c2556ab66d864bae404f3/image.png)",
